    "tpa_score_new": "<div>\n<div>Excel/Word</div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>隨堂練習+點名&nbsp;(25%)</li>\n\t<li>評量考試 (25%)</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div>App實作</div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>課堂點名 (10%)</li>\n\t<li>隨堂作業 (40%)</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n",
